WEBVTT

00:08.360 --> 00:10.030
We're here, Nephrites.

00:10.030 --> 00:11.620
Wait for me!

00:13.160 --> 00:16.040
This place is said to be
at the edge of the world.

00:16.040 --> 00:17.960
It's surprisingly bustling.

00:17.960 --> 00:19.920
The Kingdom of Water, Maasa.

00:19.920 --> 00:21.420
It may be at the border,

00:21.420 --> 00:23.960
but this is the most thriving city.

00:23.960 --> 00:26.370
By the way, where is Marse?

00:27.050 --> 00:31.150
He had something to tend to
and went on ahead.

00:31.150 --> 00:32.430
I see.

00:32.800 --> 00:35.310
He's always wanted to
come here, after all.

00:35.310 --> 00:37.310
There must be a reason for that.

00:40.560 --> 00:41.890
Excuse me!

00:45.530 --> 00:49.280
You must be the Ring King, right?

00:49.610 --> 00:51.570
Yes.

00:51.570 --> 00:52.700
Wonderful!

00:53.280 --> 00:54.910
I'm your biggest fan!

00:54.910 --> 00:58.200
Hey, you're embarrassing me.

00:58.200 --> 00:59.500
You're quite popular here.

00:59.500 --> 01:01.250
As expected from my husband.

01:01.460 --> 01:03.580
Oh, right.
Please accept this bouquet.

01:04.540 --> 01:06.500
And this too.

01:30.070 --> 01:32.530
I heard rumors about you,

01:33.870 --> 01:36.450
but you're such a careless fool!

01:36.740 --> 01:38.080
Ring King!

01:38.080 --> 01:38.830
Wha...?!

01:40.000 --> 01:42.040
My name is Saphir Maasa.

01:43.210 --> 01:45.390
The Ring Princess of Water.

01:46.210 --> 01:50.110
From now on,
you are my husband.

01:51.260 --> 01:52.950
Is this even allowed?

01:52.950 --> 01:54.220
Yeah.

02:04.810 --> 02:11.990
TALES OF WEDDING RINGS

03:25.560 --> 03:28.980
Thank you for aiding us,

03:28.980 --> 03:30.820
Ring Princess of Water.

03:31.400 --> 03:33.070
Don't mention it.

03:33.070 --> 03:36.110
You seem pretty calm, Great Sage.

03:36.110 --> 03:37.200
As for the others...

03:39.610 --> 03:40.540
Oh?

03:41.450 --> 03:44.950
I've met the other princesses,
so that's enough.

03:44.950 --> 03:47.830
We're not going to
be best friends anyway.

03:48.750 --> 03:50.040
Now, Ring King,

03:50.500 --> 03:52.840
since I've made you my husband,

03:52.840 --> 03:55.750
you're the king of this country.

03:56.220 --> 03:57.880
I knew it...

03:57.880 --> 04:01.410
It's your duty and responsibility
to bring stability to this country.

04:01.410 --> 04:03.350
I hope you're ready for that.

04:04.200 --> 04:05.180
Yes.

04:05.560 --> 04:07.190
Come with me.

04:07.190 --> 04:11.560
Unleash your true potential for me.

04:11.560 --> 04:13.900
My full potential?

04:13.900 --> 04:15.030
What's going on here?

04:16.490 --> 04:19.110
At this rate, this country
is going to be destroyed.

04:22.620 --> 04:24.870
There you are,

04:24.870 --> 04:25.950
Princess Saphir.

04:28.210 --> 04:30.250
Please return to the palace.

04:31.630 --> 04:33.840
This is the Ring King.

04:33.840 --> 04:36.050
I just made him my husband

04:36.050 --> 04:38.590
and gave him Maasa's Ring of Water.

04:38.930 --> 04:41.300
Will there be a problem?

04:42.430 --> 04:43.550
Understood.

04:43.930 --> 04:45.890
Please follow us to the palace.

04:50.730 --> 04:52.940
So huge!

04:53.270 --> 04:56.360
The great waterfall El-Wuyo Massa.

04:56.360 --> 05:00.240
An iconic landmark of this country.

05:01.410 --> 05:05.580
Beyond that waterfall is
the old Kingdom of Earth.

05:05.580 --> 05:09.790
It's also known as the Dark Domain,
where the Abyss King resides.

05:11.790 --> 05:12.960
Look.

05:13.330 --> 05:17.380
The empire's soldiers are everywhere.

05:17.380 --> 05:19.800
Maasa no long has an army.

05:19.800 --> 05:23.300
The empire...
Isn't that Mr. Marse's country?

05:23.300 --> 05:25.350
You actually remember.

05:25.350 --> 05:27.140
Of course, I remember.

05:27.390 --> 05:30.850
The largest country ever founded
by the human race, the Gisaras Empire,

05:30.850 --> 05:34.610
is joining hands with many countries
to expand its territory.

05:34.880 --> 05:37.530
Then the old man from earlier...

05:37.530 --> 05:39.820
The First Prince of Gisaras,

05:39.820 --> 05:41.390
Marse's older brother.

05:42.740 --> 05:46.240
The Undefeated General,
Prince Sluder Gisaras.

05:46.240 --> 05:50.410
He's the one in charge of
executing the emperor's orders.

05:50.410 --> 05:53.500
We got away for being
one of the Ring Kingdoms,

05:53.500 --> 05:57.000
but he is the conqueror
who has seized many countries.

05:57.340 --> 06:00.970
Is the empire actually the bad guy?

06:00.970 --> 06:02.680
Isn't that obvious?

06:03.380 --> 06:05.790
This is command and invade.

06:05.790 --> 06:08.260
They said it was to protect us
from the Abyssal Creatures,

06:08.260 --> 06:09.930
but that was just an excuse.

06:10.270 --> 06:13.020
Some share that idea,

06:13.020 --> 06:15.440
but it's the truth
that they united everyone

06:15.440 --> 06:19.070
to prevent the resurrection
of the Abyss King.

06:19.400 --> 06:21.590
You're very knowledgeable.

06:21.590 --> 06:22.950
Are you impressed?

06:23.280 --> 06:25.450
What can a beast possibly know?

06:26.410 --> 06:28.120
Cursed woman...

06:28.120 --> 06:31.660
I'm going to crush you
and mix your remains with the cat powder!

06:35.750 --> 06:37.850
This must be the palace.

06:42.970 --> 06:44.050
What was that?

06:44.380 --> 06:46.000
Monsters are attacking.

06:46.430 --> 06:48.390
Another prediction came true.

06:48.760 --> 06:50.140
Aren't you worried?

06:50.140 --> 06:53.230
The empire's soldiers are here
to defend us.

06:54.810 --> 06:55.940
Satou, watch out!

07:00.190 --> 07:00.910
Wha—

07:03.400 --> 07:04.450
Impossible!

07:04.450 --> 07:05.910
How can it be here?!

07:08.200 --> 07:09.280
Ring King!

07:24.550 --> 07:26.260
That was close.

07:28.930 --> 07:30.930
So this is the power of the rings...

07:31.430 --> 07:33.970
- Thank goodness you're all right.
- Ring King Satou...

07:33.970 --> 07:35.390
- I managed it somehow.
- This guy...

07:35.390 --> 07:37.140
That's my husband for you.

07:40.190 --> 07:43.550
The legends are not just fairy tales, huh?

07:48.070 --> 07:51.330
So, this is the Ring King?

07:51.600 --> 07:53.120
Yes, Father.

07:53.120 --> 07:54.910
He is now my husband.

07:55.370 --> 07:58.170
The Ring of Water belongs to him now.

07:58.170 --> 07:58.790
Hey!

07:59.170 --> 08:04.170
It seemed you wanted to keep me here
so I couldn't hand over the ring.

08:04.710 --> 08:08.210
I thwarted your plan.

08:08.210 --> 08:09.680
Keeping you here?

08:10.140 --> 08:12.890
What are you talking about?

08:14.100 --> 08:15.350
Cursed vixen.

08:16.100 --> 08:20.020
The army of monsters is approaching.

08:20.020 --> 08:22.150
Please don't act on your own.

08:22.480 --> 08:26.070
Things just got a lot more complicated now.

08:26.070 --> 08:26.900
Right?

08:29.450 --> 08:31.160
As you predicted,

08:31.160 --> 08:33.950
the Ring King now has the ring!

08:34.539 --> 08:39.250
That means my kingdom will face
an even greater calamity!

08:40.080 --> 08:41.669
Ring King!

08:41.669 --> 08:44.250
Why did you have to come here?!

08:45.300 --> 08:46.340
How is it my fault?

08:54.640 --> 08:58.270
Oh my, we wouldn't want
your body to take a toll.

08:58.560 --> 09:00.690
Let's move you somewhere
so you can rest.

09:00.690 --> 09:02.860
Curse you, Ring King!

09:04.520 --> 09:07.990
Is that suspicious woman
your mother, Saphir?

09:07.990 --> 09:09.570
Does it look that way?!

09:10.030 --> 09:12.610
She is a seer the palace has hired.

09:13.120 --> 09:14.660
At some point,

09:14.660 --> 09:18.660
my father grew very dependent on her
and became the husk he is now.

09:19.040 --> 09:22.080
To think my father was once
known as the Virtuous King.

09:27.420 --> 09:28.840
Big Sister!

09:28.840 --> 09:29.900
Why?

09:31.010 --> 09:33.590
We swore we'd decide

09:33.590 --> 09:36.560
who should be the Ring Princess together!

09:36.890 --> 09:39.520
Sorry, but I've made my decision.

09:40.310 --> 09:41.770
How could you?

09:43.810 --> 09:46.110
Big sister? So that's mean...

09:46.110 --> 09:46.940
Yeah.

09:47.400 --> 09:49.780
She is my twin sister,

09:49.780 --> 09:50.900
Saphira.

09:51.200 --> 09:53.150
A twin princess?!

09:54.620 --> 09:57.580
Why did you do it, Saphir?

09:58.160 --> 09:59.120
Why?

09:59.120 --> 10:01.580
Why did you marry
that mediocre-looking guy?

10:01.580 --> 10:03.040
Ugh...!

10:03.580 --> 10:08.000
You could've married someone better...

10:09.260 --> 10:11.300
Did you do it for me?

10:11.720 --> 10:12.880
How cruel!

10:12.880 --> 10:15.800
Destiny has been so cruel to us!

10:15.800 --> 10:17.970
Excuse me, Princess Saphira,

10:18.390 --> 10:22.100
Satou managed to defeat me in combat.

10:23.640 --> 10:28.270
Well, he's not particularly reliable
when it comes to a fight.

10:28.270 --> 10:30.190
You are supposed to defend me!

10:30.190 --> 10:31.820
So...

10:31.820 --> 10:35.360
I'm an elf, so I don't really understand
humans' standards for beauty.

10:35.360 --> 10:37.120
I'd rather not make any comment.

10:37.450 --> 10:39.330
Not you too, Nephrites...

10:39.330 --> 10:40.580
Satou...

10:41.000 --> 10:42.500
Satou...

10:43.000 --> 10:45.210
Satou is really cool!

10:45.210 --> 10:46.920
Thank you, Hime!

10:48.250 --> 10:49.090
Whatever.

10:49.090 --> 10:50.380
I don't want to hear it!

10:50.670 --> 10:54.020
You don't have to marry
the Ring King now.

10:55.550 --> 10:57.800
It's no longer your concern.

10:58.260 --> 10:59.680
Big sister...

11:02.520 --> 11:03.600
Princess Saphira!

11:10.570 --> 11:13.240
What is it?
The atmosphere got too tense.

11:13.610 --> 11:17.740
I know everything I say at this point
will sound like an excuse to you,

11:19.570 --> 11:22.350
but I've never forgotten our promise!

11:25.080 --> 11:26.790
I don't want to hear...

11:27.500 --> 11:29.560
...your voice anymore.

11:31.710 --> 11:32.960
Princess Saphira?!

11:35.090 --> 11:38.530
You're still as worthless as ever, Marse.

11:43.270 --> 11:47.020
Mr. Marse has always
wanted to come here.

11:47.020 --> 11:48.350
Could it be...

11:48.350 --> 11:52.750
That man was Saphira's lover.

11:52.750 --> 11:54.360
LOVE ROMANCE?!

11:54.360 --> 11:57.210
You didn't know?

11:57.210 --> 12:00.160
It does seem like something he'd do.

12:01.160 --> 12:03.410
I'll tell you the story

12:03.830 --> 12:06.910
about Maasa and their empire,

12:06.910 --> 12:09.710
the Gisaras Empire.

12:13.460 --> 12:16.050
In the past, the Gisaras Empire

12:16.050 --> 12:18.840
wasn't satisfied with conquering
the lands of humans.

12:18.840 --> 12:23.810
They went as far as invading
the Kingdom of Water, Maasa.

12:25.100 --> 12:27.270
But no battle ever broke out.

12:27.270 --> 12:29.810
The empire knew
it couldn't take Maasa by force,

12:29.810 --> 12:32.770
so it hoped to strengthen
the diplomatic ties.

12:34.320 --> 12:38.140
I am the Second Prince of the Gisaras Empire,
Marmarugias Gisaras.

12:38.140 --> 12:41.050
We'd like to learn from Maasa,
which has a long-standing history,

12:41.050 --> 12:44.380
and improve the relationship
between our countries.

12:51.670 --> 12:55.750
They soon became very close.

12:59.680 --> 13:02.590
There was no doubt
that they loved each other.

13:02.590 --> 13:04.560
Or at least I thought so.

13:04.930 --> 13:08.600
Even if Marse had an unspeakable mission.

13:09.940 --> 13:12.270
Please take me!

13:12.900 --> 13:14.440
Marse's mission...

13:14.440 --> 13:18.900
...was to deliver confidential information
about Maasa to the empire.

13:18.900 --> 13:20.450
Please wait for me.

13:21.780 --> 13:24.490
However, he never did it.

13:25.160 --> 13:27.830
I'll come for you someday.

13:27.830 --> 13:29.290
Prince Marse...

13:30.040 --> 13:31.870
I believe you.

13:33.460 --> 13:37.880
The empire always deals with those
who can't fulfill their missions.

13:38.210 --> 13:40.840
Marse was summoned back
to the empire.

13:40.840 --> 13:43.470
Several months later...

13:44.260 --> 13:47.660
I will become the Ring King,
as per the emperor's order.

13:48.430 --> 13:51.310
Then, I can finally marry you.

13:54.400 --> 13:57.780
Despite it being a twisted marriage
to fulfill the Ring King's duty,

13:57.780 --> 14:00.650
she had the chance
to marry the one she loved.

14:01.200 --> 14:04.760
We were born to become Ring Princesses.

14:04.760 --> 14:09.240
That was a fate too luxurious
to even think about.

14:11.000 --> 14:11.620
In the end,

14:12.410 --> 14:15.330
Prince Marse gave up
on becoming the Ring King.

14:17.800 --> 14:22.800
He let a stranger from
another world take the ring.

14:23.630 --> 14:27.600
He broke his promise to Saphira.

14:29.890 --> 14:31.020
Princess Saphira!

14:31.390 --> 14:33.060
Please hear me out!

14:33.350 --> 14:36.520
My love for you has never changed!

14:36.520 --> 14:38.730
I've always loved you!

14:40.320 --> 14:41.860
So why?!

14:42.650 --> 14:45.910
Why didn't you become the Ring King?

14:49.270 --> 14:50.250
That's because...

14:51.080 --> 14:52.140
I didn't think...

14:53.750 --> 14:55.860
...I was worthy of that role.

14:57.710 --> 15:02.170
I can't understand
what's going on in your mind.

15:10.810 --> 15:15.270
The seer showed up afterward.

15:16.310 --> 15:19.610
At first, no one believed her.

15:19.610 --> 15:23.740
Not until her prediction came true.

15:24.900 --> 15:28.910
To fend off the monsters,
the seer's predictions will come in handy.

15:29.530 --> 15:32.740
That's why Father kept her here.

15:33.200 --> 15:35.660
That was how he became
the way he is now.

15:36.670 --> 15:39.920
Do you think the seer
was sent here by the empire?

15:40.340 --> 15:42.380
There must be a connection between them.

15:42.920 --> 15:48.010
It's exactly why I want to catch that vixen
and expose her true nature.

15:50.890 --> 15:52.350
Cursed Saphir.

15:52.350 --> 15:53.720
She ruined my plan.

15:55.310 --> 15:58.520
Kill the Ring King
and get the rings.

15:58.520 --> 16:01.230
This is for the glory of our great king!

16:01.230 --> 16:01.950
Yes!

16:13.740 --> 16:15.290
I really envy him!

16:15.290 --> 16:17.000
No, this is indecent.

16:17.330 --> 16:19.920
Hold on. One of them is missing.

16:19.920 --> 16:20.960
The catfolk woman...

16:24.000 --> 16:26.880
An attack while everyone
is fast asleep, I see.

16:26.880 --> 16:29.380
The Ring Princess of Water
was right, after all.

16:30.180 --> 16:31.430
No horns?

16:31.930 --> 16:33.310
Are they just normal humans?

16:43.110 --> 16:45.450
I knew it.
The empire sent them.

16:47.900 --> 16:49.360
Assassins?

16:49.360 --> 16:50.220
Correct.

16:51.780 --> 16:53.450
So, it was real.

17:09.010 --> 17:12.089
By the way, where are we headed now?

17:12.089 --> 17:13.599
To get basked in sunlight.

17:17.680 --> 17:20.770
The dragon-kins can't regulate
their body temperature.

17:20.770 --> 17:24.560
They become slow
when the body temperature drops.

17:25.050 --> 17:26.819
I see.

17:26.819 --> 17:30.570
That's why she came here right after
waking up and trying to warm her body.

17:31.360 --> 17:35.450
When the temperature gets too high,
they cool down with water.

17:36.660 --> 17:38.820
Aren't you going to join them, Granart?

17:39.250 --> 17:40.500
I'll take a pass today.

17:41.370 --> 17:42.580
More importantly,

17:43.290 --> 17:46.340
I said you were unreliable as a warrior,

17:46.340 --> 17:47.750
but you have a good figure.

17:48.210 --> 17:51.550
It makes me want to have
a baby with you, Satou.

17:52.050 --> 17:54.000
Well? How about we do it tonight?

17:54.470 --> 17:56.050
No, wait...!

17:56.050 --> 17:57.310
You can't be the first...!

17:57.310 --> 18:00.310
That's Princess Krystal's
wishful thinking.

18:00.310 --> 18:02.270
Hey! What are you doing there?!

18:02.600 --> 18:04.900
I should be the first!

18:04.900 --> 18:08.070
Your waiting love is too weak!

18:08.070 --> 18:10.900
My love for Satou is very passionate!

18:14.240 --> 18:16.830
I don't mind getting in the line.

18:17.660 --> 18:19.200
Hold on!

18:20.040 --> 18:22.870
A bunch of fools!

18:24.920 --> 18:28.840
TIGHT
S-Saphir, that swimsuit...

18:28.840 --> 18:31.010
This is my backyard.

18:31.010 --> 18:32.470
I usually walk around naked.

18:32.470 --> 18:34.290
I only put this on because of you.

18:35.090 --> 18:39.260
By the way, if you're so concerned
about who gets to do it first,

18:39.260 --> 18:41.850
why not have a contest?

18:41.850 --> 18:42.890
For example,

18:42.890 --> 18:46.400
the first to swim over there wins.

18:46.770 --> 18:47.980
What?

18:48.730 --> 18:49.690
Meow!

18:50.320 --> 18:52.650
Are you afraid of water?

18:55.110 --> 18:56.030
Eat this!

18:56.030 --> 18:57.280
- A bunch of utter fools.
- Get this!

18:57.280 --> 18:58.910
- A bunch of utter fools.
- Stop! I hate water!

18:58.910 --> 19:00.830
Erm, I want to...

19:02.040 --> 19:04.160
By the way, Satou,

19:04.160 --> 19:07.250
the seer hasn't given up her plan yet.

19:07.790 --> 19:12.460
Stay vigilant, even if you're pretending
to let your guard down.

19:12.810 --> 19:14.950
Wait, this is just an act?

19:14.950 --> 19:17.300
This is a great opportunity
to expose that seer.

19:17.640 --> 19:19.130
Do not miss it.

19:28.190 --> 19:29.270
Mr. Marse.

19:30.900 --> 19:33.650
You're in a pretty tough position.

19:33.650 --> 19:34.910
I can say the same to you.

19:36.530 --> 19:41.240
It's somewhat my fault
that Maasa became the way it is now.

19:41.910 --> 19:43.500
I feel like I've failed them.

19:46.000 --> 19:50.110
Why did you let me become
the Ring King?

19:50.670 --> 19:51.680
If you hadn't,

19:52.210 --> 19:54.220
you could've married Princess Saphira.

19:56.680 --> 19:58.800
It was a burden
that was too heavy for me.

19:59.470 --> 20:00.850
That's all.

20:02.100 --> 20:04.100
Is that all?

20:04.560 --> 20:06.890
If you have a reason
to become the Ring King,

20:06.890 --> 20:09.310
you can take the rings for yourself.

20:10.610 --> 20:12.020
She reminded me of her.

20:13.650 --> 20:16.650
The look on Princess Krystal's face
reminded me of Saphira.

20:17.490 --> 20:21.410
She was reunited with her lover.

20:23.160 --> 20:25.510
Knowing how she felt,

20:25.510 --> 20:27.430
I couldn't let myself get in the way.

20:29.460 --> 20:34.500
It's my flaw for not taking
what I want by any means necessary.

20:35.420 --> 20:37.670
I don't blame Father
for calling me worthless.

20:39.090 --> 20:43.010
But you abandoned everything
for Princess Krystal's sake.

20:44.060 --> 20:46.390
You are more worthy
of becoming the Ring King

20:46.390 --> 20:48.350
than I am.

20:52.730 --> 20:53.690
Brother!

20:54.480 --> 20:57.360
Please reconsider!

20:57.360 --> 21:00.410
We agreed not to intervene in Maasa.

21:00.950 --> 21:03.870
It's Father's order
to send reinforcements here.

21:04.160 --> 21:08.130
You haven't been forgiven for going against
the order and not becoming the Ring King.

21:08.130 --> 21:11.250
But you've done your part
to earn the Ring King's trust.

21:11.250 --> 21:14.290
We know their plan.

21:14.840 --> 21:16.960
Father considers that your redemption.

21:19.260 --> 21:22.050
You must answer
Father's expectations, Marse.

21:22.760 --> 21:26.430
The Gisaras Empire is
the only place you can return to.

21:40.200 --> 21:41.610
What do you want?

21:42.610 --> 21:45.870
Take the ring, Prince Marse.

21:46.410 --> 21:47.700
Don't be ridiculous.

21:48.120 --> 21:50.660
That is the emperor's order!

21:51.250 --> 21:54.330
You've earned the Ring King's trust

21:54.330 --> 21:56.460
for this very purpose.

21:57.210 --> 22:01.590
Three days from now,
an army of monsters will attack Maasa.

22:01.590 --> 22:05.640
Make use of the chaos
and kill the Ring King.
